  "description": "Certificate of Lawful Development (Existing): Single storey rear extension; conversion of garage into habitable room; external alterations",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 93.7pt;&quot;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;he evidence submitted demonstrates that the single storey rear extension and garage conversion into a habitable room at 66 Whitmore Road, West Harrow, Harrow, HA1 4AD was in situ and in use as part of the main dwellinghouse for a continuous period of at least 4 years prior to the date of this application on 30/03/2026. The construction of the single storey rear extension and garage conversion into a habitable room is therefore immune from enforcement action under S.171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) and is lawful under Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;"
